// sheet is a 192x192 PNG laid out as 4 rows (down, left, right, up) x 4 walk
// frames, 48px per tile; columns 1 & 3 are the neutral idle poses. Classes listed
// in HERO_WALK have bespoke male/female art; the rest use the atlas hero tile (see
