// Within each row the 4 columns are the walk frames in order; columns 1 and 3 are
// the neutral "passing" poses, so the standing/idle pose is column 1.
const HERO_WALK_IDLE = 1;
// Walk frames advanced per tile travelled — ties the stride cadence to actual
