// ══════════════════════════════════════════
// SKILL ENGINE — charges · triggers · synergies · transforms · keystones
// The mechanics layer that makes passives game-changing instead of stat bumps.
// A skill node may carry, beyond fx/cfx:
//   charge:{id,max,fx}         defines a stacking combat charge (per-stack fx)
//   trigger:{on,effect,chance} fires on a combat event (kill/crit/dodge/block/hit/lowhp/cast)
//   syn:[{skill,per}]          D2 synergy: this ACTIVE's damage +per × hard points in `skill`
//   mod:{skill,...}            transform a specific ACTIVE's cast (pierce/radius/pull/status/…)
//   kflag:'name'               a keystone rule-flag read at a specific combat site
// ══════════════════════════════════════════
// Transient combat charges — generated by triggered passives, spent as bonuses.
